    <briefdescription>
<para>A customizable stream proxy for formatting and printing C++ ranges. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This struct acts as a wrapper around any <computeroutput>std::ranges::range</computeroutput>, allowing it to be piped into a standard output stream with configurable separators and bounding characters.</para>
<sect3 id="structgl_1_1io_1_1range__formatter_1example-usage-17">
<title>Example Usage</title>
<para><programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="normal">std::vector&lt;int&gt;<sp/><ref refid="group__GL-Core_1gaaae078e2ee09bb6b088baac9cb8f23c9" kindref="member">vec</ref><sp/>=<sp/>{1,<sp/>2,<sp/>3};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">std::cout<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/><ref refid="structgl_1_1io_1_1range__formatter" kindref="compound">gl::io::range_formatter</ref>{<ref refid="group__GL-Core_1gaaae078e2ee09bb6b088baac9cb8f23c9" kindref="member">vec</ref>}<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="charliteral">&apos;\n&apos;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">std::cout<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/><ref refid="structgl_1_1io_1_1range__formatter" kindref="compound">gl::io::range_formatter</ref>{<ref refid="group__GL-Core_1gaaae078e2ee09bb6b088baac9cb8f23c9" kindref="member">vec</ref>,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;<sp/>|<sp/>&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;&lt;&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;&gt;&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">}<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="charliteral">&apos;\n&apos;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><bold>Output:</bold> <programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">[1,<sp/>2,<sp/>3]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">&lt;1<sp/>|<sp/>2<sp/>|<sp/>3&gt;</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect3>
